# AI Native CMS — Apache CMS-directory reference
#
# Copy this file to /cms/.htaccess only when the host permits per-directory
# Apache configuration. It prevents authenticated operator HTML, JavaScript,
# and CSS from remaining stale across deployments. Non-Apache hosts should
# apply the equivalent no-store/private policy to the entire /cms/ path.

Options -Indexes

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set Cache-Control "no-store, private"
  Header always set Pragma "no-cache"
  Header always set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet"
</IfModule>
